    <item>
      <title>Making the case for a non-primary article</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s43588-026-01078-7</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Computational Science, Published online: 22 October 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s43588-026-01078-7"&gt;doi:10.1038/s43588-026-01078-7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Author-proposed non-primary articles can bring fresh and timely perspectives to the journal. Here, we discuss the factors that editors consider when assessing proposals for these contributions.</content:encoded>
