    <item>
      <title>Structure-coefficient theorem for evolutionary games on dynamic networks</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s43588-026-01068-9</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Computational Science, Published online: 22 October 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s43588-026-01068-9"&gt;doi:10.1038/s43588-026-01068-9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;The authors establish a structure-coefficient theorem, showing that three universal coefficients capture evolutionary outcomes in changing networks, and identify dynamic core–periphery networks that promote cooperation, altruism, fairness and trust.</content:encoded>
